{"id":"snesti","lemma":"снести","pos":"verb","rank":4868,"glosses":["to carry down","to carry to","to pull down, to demolish"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"снесу","2s":"снесёшь","3s":"снесёт","1p":"снесём","2p":"снесёте","3p":"снесут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"снеси","2p":"снесите"}}},"past":{"m":"снёс","p":"снесли","f":"снесла","n":"снесло"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"сносить","examples":[{"text":"Мы должны снести этот дом.","en":"We must tear down this house.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"house, building"}]},{"text":"Я тебе снесу голову.","en":"I'm going to blow your head off.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,null]},{"text":"Я должен снести стену.","en":"I have to tear down the wall.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,null]},{"text":"Ещё один шаг - и я снесу тебе голову.","en":"One more step and I'll blow your head off.","words":[{"g":"still / more"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"step"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Том собирается снести свой дом.","en":"Tom is going to tear his house down.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to gather, to assemble","l":"собираться"},null,{"g":"one's own"},{"g":"house, building"}]}]}